<title>FRANCE: Eridania Q1 sales 14.85 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Eridania Q1 sales 14.85 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					14,854    vs   13,005</p>
<p>NOTE - Eridania Beghin-Say reported its first-quarter turnover in the official bulletin BALO. It said sales at comparable structure and exchange rates rose 5.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
